  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fondo Hondureno de Inversion Social II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hondurean Social Investment Fund II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE SUPPORT TO FHIS FOR UP TO US$40 MILLION (SECOND OF THE BANK), WILL PERMIT FINANCING OF SMALL WORKS THAT AID THE URGENT NEEDS OF THE POOREST COMMUNITIES, MAKING POSSIBLE THEIR ACCESS TO SOCIAL INFRASTRUCTURE AND SERVICES, SUCH AS HEALTH, EDUCATION AND WATER AND SANITATION. THE LOAN HAS THREE COMPONENTS: (I) INSTITUCIONAL STRENGTHENING AND PROGRAM MANAGEMENT; (II) SOCIAL INFRASTRUCTURE; AND (III) BASIC NEEDS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
